{"lines":[{"w":0.060405305226643877,"y":0.04190357911508058,"t":"Test 4","c":1,"h":0.015030051020446966,"x":0.091156570590936029},{"w":0.14368932088216152,"y":0.090116278945803763,"x":0.43106796082852344,"h":0.017441860686210009,"t":"READING","c":1},{"y":0.15545171310029549,"t":"READING PASSAGE 1","c":1,"x":0.089320390475207317,"w":0.30679611206054691,"h":0.016199376947040434},{"x":0.091262132365922163,"w":0.81165049235026032,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 1-13, which are based on Reading","y":0.19470404982808565,"c":1,"h":0.019003115264797477},{"w":0.16699029286702471,"h":0.015988371899566145,"t":"Passage 1 below.","c":1,"x":0.089320387431690948,"y":0.21366279078281725},{"x":0.41938838176393251,"w":0.17675721486409507,"h":0.022066906605182735,"c":1,"t":"Green roofs","y":0.24986770933073477},{"t":"Rooftops covered with grass, vegetable gardens and lush foliage are now a common sight","w":0.76699030558268233,"h":0.017484423676012439,"y":0.29501557643227516,"c":1,"x":0.13592232283846917},{"h":0.017510686262374398,"w":0.74563105265299479,"c":1,"y":0.31395348825921432,"t":"in many cities around the world. More and more private companies and city authorities","x":0.13203884250637732},{"y":0.32837848271174253,"h":0.022829613135982529,"t":"are investing in green roofs, drawn to their wide-ranging benefits. Among the benefits are","w":0.76520345052083338,"x":0.1339009413643574,"c":1},{"y":0.35015576343013,"h":0.019030282801928089,"x":0.13398058833252302,"w":0.75145629882812504,"t":"saving on energy costs, mitigating the risk of floods, making habitats for urban wildlife,","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.36760124605128897,"w":0.77475728352864581,"x":0.13398058170585747,"h":0.019026660622094682,"t":"tackling air pollution and even growing food. These increasingly radical urban designs can"},{"h":0.018895348284474811,"y":0.38808139562163935,"c":1,"t":"help cities adapt to the monumental problems they face, such as access to resources and a","w":0.76893203735351567,"x":0.1339805831206409},{"c":1,"t":"lack of green space due to development. But the involvement of city authorities, businesses","w":0.78058252970377606,"h":0.018895348284474811,"y":0.40552325585412885,"x":0.13398058043937416},{"x":0.13390735069302867,"c":1,"w":0.72835052490234387,"h":0.021436730500693724,"y":0.4219160435729421,"t":"and other institutions is crucial to ensuring their success - as is research investigating"},{"h":0.017453633364858723,"y":0.44330218069615901,"t":"different options to suit the variety of rooftop spaces found in cities. The UK is relatively","w":0.75922327677408852,"c":1,"x":0.13592234209973639},{"w":0.77100209554036458,"y":0.46159618788286894,"c":1,"x":0.133920664348535,"h":0.020291883997456628,"t":"new to developing green roofs, and local governments and institutions are playing a major"},{"c":1,"y":0.47962556339692231,"w":0.74187240600585946,"t":"role in spreading the practice. London is home to much of the UK's green roof market,","x":0.13392956641865378,"h":0.020400085924570432},{"t":"mainly due to forward-thinking policies such as the London Plan, which has paved the way","y":0.49760941976457773,"x":0.13391357497247744,"h":0.021942450027228055,"w":0.77878372192382805,"c":1},{"y":0.51744186050529173,"w":0.51067957560221355,"h":0.019006737444630994,"c":1,"x":0.13398060392219407,"t":"to more than doubling the area of green roofs in the capital."},{"t":"Ongoing research is showcasing how green roofs in cities can integrate withiliving walls':","h":0.01883191676154683,"c":1,"x":0.13394560763684618,"w":0.77483678181966154,"y":0.55520649801307342},{"h":0.016007389532071481,"c":1,"t":"environmentally friendly walls which are partially or completely covered with greenery,","x":0.13398057081372391,"y":0.57558139544312847,"w":0.75339808146158849},{"c":1,"h":0.017568644704848424,"x":0.13203884593805887,"y":0.59302325570044034,"t":"including a growing medium, such as soil or water. Research also indicates that green","w":0.73398056030273429},{"y":0.61102424634551478,"t":"roofs can be integrated with drainage systems on the ground, such as street trees, so that","h":0.020559811220733581,"c":1,"x":0.13390671425787956,"w":0.75353820800781246},{"w":0.7417475891113281,"c":1,"x":0.13398057427515597,"y":0.63081395337473267,"h":0.017472650997363837,"t":"the water is managed better and the built environment is made more sustainable. There"},{"w":0.74951456705729158,"c":1,"y":0.64970930221273948,"h":0.017580417383497027,"t":"is also evidence to demonstrate the social value of green roofs. Doctors are increasingly","x":0.13398058045040367},{"y":0.66715116283087306,"x":0.13398058524519921,"t":"prescribing time spent gardening outdoors for patients dealing with anxiety and depression.","c":1,"w":0.78058252970377595,"h":0.018895348284474811},{"w":0.78058252970377606,"c":1,"t":"And research has found that access to even the most basic green spaces can provide a better","y":0.68749999988707677,"h":0.017484423676012439,"x":0.1359223272821824},{"w":0.57475728352864586,"x":0.13592233401237608,"t":"quality of life for dementia sufferers and help people avoid obesity.","c":1,"h":0.019045678254599907,"y":0.70494186050529173},{"t":"C","h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"y":0.7427325583224148,"w":0.017475727399190247,"x":0.089320388614320734},{"y":0.74267912769555111,"c":1,"h":0.019003115264797477,"x":0.13398058218000414,"w":0.74368932088216155,"t":"In North America, green roofs have become mainstream, with a wide array of expansive,"},{"h":0.019003115264797477,"y":0.76012461032217504,"c":1,"x":0.13398058907949442,"w":0.77669901529947916,"t":"accessible and food-producing roofs installed in buildings. Again, city leaders and authorities"},{"t":"have helped push the movement forward - only recently, San Francisco, USA, created a","w":0.73398056030273429,"h":0.017591284517187167,"x":0.13398059353584255,"c":1,"y":0.78037383187005971},{"t":"policy requiring new buildings to have green roofs. Toronto, Canada, has policies dating from","w":0.78068730672200515,"h":0.020458768089983703,"x":0.13392810846761979,"y":0.79788658162694059,"c":1},{"w":0.74575861612955729,"t":"the 1990s, encouraging the development of urban farms on rooftops. These countries also","y":0.81512107173183113,"x":0.13391287466704493,"h":0.020903160118982411,"c":1},{"t":"benefit from having newer buildings than in many parts of the world, which makes it easier to","w":0.78058252970377606,"h":0.0188953482844747,"x":0.1339805797274001,"y":0.83575581422682765,"c":1},{"t":"install green roofs. Being able to keep enough water at roof height and distribute it right across","x":0.13203884109068459,"h":0.018895348284474811,"y":0.85319767445878003,"w":0.790291239420573,"c":1},{"h":0.019025755077136219,"c":1,"x":0.13398057009012576,"w":0.78446604410807286,"t":"the rooftop is crucial to maintaining the plants on any green roof - especially on 'edible roofs'","y":0.87196261673603359},{"y":0.89069289727313727,"x":0.1358656077195633,"t":"where fruit and vegetables are farmed. And it's much easier to do this in newer buildings,","w":0.74382344563802083,"h":0.020668520585770178,"c":1},{"x":0.13592233692569095,"h":0.019017604578321134,"w":0.77669901529947927,"c":1,"t":"which can typically hold greater weight, than to retro-fit old ones. Having a stronger roof also","y":0.91121495328192148},{"c":1,"x":0.13398057477413952,"t":"makes it easier to grow a greater variety of plants, since the soil can be deeper.","y":0.93021806850481459,"w":0.65436894734700524,"h":0.019003115264797477},{"t":"84","x":0.089320387596830739,"y":0.95784883724453707,"w":0.027184467315673824,"h":0.015988371899566256,"c":1}],"w":2400,"h":3209}